     "set": {
      "hidden": false,
      "text": "body runs 1 time"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "for: the initialisation runs once, then the test, exactly as in while.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "b20",
     "set": {
      "tone": "accent",
      "fill": "accent"
     }
    },
    {
     "id": "b21",
     "set": {
      "tone": "accent"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "The test is false, so the body and the increment never run: a for loop is a while loop with its parts gathered.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "id": "b20",
     "set": {
      "tone": "success",
      "fill": "none"
     }
    },
